        {
          "kicker": "Test allegiance",
          "heading": "Mark Nawaqanitawase's Test choice stays open as Wallabies captain offers verdict",
          "body": "Mark Nawaqanitawase has not yet officially committed his Test future to Fiji or Australia. Fresh headlines include a Wallabies captain's verdict on his future, headlined ‘It’s pretty obvious’, and an ESPN piece on Wallabies interest in his return to rugby, headlined ‘A freak’. Sir Steve Hansen has said he would be better off playing for Fiji, a view reported at the weekend."
