        {
          "kicker": "Squad switch",
          "heading": "Ex-Pumas flyhalf Domingo Miotti called up by Italy for Springboks Test",
          "body": "Italy coach Gonzalo Quesada has picked Domingo Miotti in a 33-man squad, a 30-year-old Montpellier flyhalf whose last of 10 Tests for Argentina came on 9 July 2022. Miotti qualifies through an Italian grandfather, and Quesada says their contact began three years ago. \"Domingo is a great player and an excellent person.\" Italy also host Argentina this month, and Miotti, injured last week, can now resume training as normal."
        },
